  "title": "Yongle Encyclopedia (Yongle Dadian)",
  "summary": "A manuscript encyclopedia ordered by the Yongle Emperor in 1403 and compiled at the then-capital Nanjing, completed in 1408 per the Library of Congress. It held 22,937 chapters in 11,095 volumes. Only about 420 to 431 volumes survive; the Library of Congress holds 41.",
